                      "insertedContent": {
                        "text": "const COMPETITIVE_CLIENT_SCORING_DISABLED = new Set([\\n  'trace', 'stopclock', 'slingshot', 'balance',\\n  'oddoneout', 'typing', 'spacemash', 'cups',\\n]);"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "description": {
                "text": "1. Add **`cups`** to `COMPETITIVE_CLIENT_SCORING_DISABLED` so hosted competitive sessions cannot queue it.\n2. Keep `startTest('cups')` and solo practice unchanged so the minigame remains available for local testing and unscored practice.\n3. Before re-enabling **`cups`** competitively, redesign scoring so the server derives results from authoritative interaction data instead of trusting a one-shot client summary payload.",
                "markdown": "1. Add **`cups`** to `COMPETITIVE_CLIENT_SCORING_DISABLED` so hosted competitive sessions cannot queue it.\n2. Keep `startTest('cups')` and solo practice unchanged so the minigame remains available for local testing and unscored practice.\n3. Before re-enabling **`cups`** competitively, redesign scoring so the server derives results from authoritative interaction data instead of trusting a one-shot client summary payload."
